{"unit_id": "tag:04PW:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一概形（scheme）。将<MATH_0002>的每个闭子概形（closed subscheme）对应到其底层闭子集（closed subset）的规则给出一个双射（bijection）\n<MATHSEG_0001>闭子概形（closed subschemes）<MATHSEG_0002>使得<MATHSEG_0003>是平坦（flat）的<MATHSEG_0004>闭子集（closed subsets）<MATHSEG_0005>对泛化（generalizations）封闭<MATHSEG_0006>\n若<MATH_0003>是这样的闭子概形（closed subscheme），则任一态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>，只要它在概形（schemes）之间且在集合（set）意义下满足<MATH_0005>，就可在概形（scheme）意义下经由<MATH_0006>分解（factors）。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集"}, {"source_term": "generalizations", "target_term": "泛化"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "引理中给定的几何对象。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "对应规则所取的对象。"}, {"source_term": "closed subset", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "对应规则所得的底层子集。"}, {"source_term": "bijection", "target_term": "双射", "context": "对应规则给出的双向一一对应。"}, {"source_term": "closed subschemes", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "双射左侧对象的复数形式。"}, {"source_term": "flat", "target_term": "平坦", "context": "双射左侧要求的性质。"}, {"source_term": "closed subsets", "target_term": "闭子集", "context": "双射右侧对象的复数形式。"}, {"source_term": "generalizations", "target_term": "泛化", "context": "双射右侧的闭子集须对此关系封闭。"}, {"source_term": "closed subscheme", "target_term": "闭子概形", "context": "末句承接前述条件的对象。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "末句量化的映射。"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形", "context": "末句态射的源和目标所属的对象类型。"}, {"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合", "context": "限定末句中条件成立的意义。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "限定末句中分解成立的意义。"}, {"source_term": "factors", "target_term": "分解", "context": "表示态射经由指定的闭子概形。"}], "notes": []}
